('nsmq_bio_pod_001', 'subj_biology', 'If a cell has 46 chromosomes, how many chromosomes will be in the gametes after meiosis?', 'problem', 'problem_of_day', NULL, '23', 'Meiosis reduces chromosome number by half: 46/2 = 23', 'easy', 5, 120),
