('nsmq_bio_pod_005', 'subj_biology', 'If the cardiac output is 5 L/min and the stroke volume is 70 mL, what is the heart rate?', 'problem', 'problem_of_day', NULL, '71 beats/min', 'CO = SV × HR. HR = 5000/70 ≈ 71 beats/min', 'hard', 5, 120),
